{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-15 17:41:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF MATCH GROUP, INC. (MTCH) INVESTORS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED MATCH GROUP, INC. (“MATCH” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: MTCH) COMMON STOCK BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021 AND JANUARY 31, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). MATCH INVESTORS HAVE UNTIL MAY 5, 2023 TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-15 01:45:00', 'title': 'MATCH GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: MTCH) SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION ALERT: BERNSTEIN LIEBHARD LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: MTCH)', 'text': 'DID YOU LOSE MONEY ON INVESTMENTS IN MATCH GROUP?\xa0 IF SO, PLEASE VISIT\xa0MATCH GROUP, INC. SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT\xa0OR CONTACT\xa0 PETER ALLOCCO AT (212) 951-2030\xa0OR\xa0PALLOCCO@BERNLIEB.COM TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS.'}